{
  "id": "poem-fb785f1aa57757143f2739a8",
  "title": "前腔",
  "author": "柯丹邱《荆钗记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "［末］恩东免嗟吁，且听覆。",
    "言清行浊心贪污，违法度，恩和义，都不顾。",
    "半载夫妻曾厮聚，一时间却把婵娟误。",
    "［合前］。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-8191",
